We've just released #HedgeDoc 1.11.1 🎉

This release contains one security fix.

Also included in this release are:
- support for WebP image file upload (except for imgur)
- fixes and improvements for the external link warning
- functioning browser zoom shortcuts
- fixes for the side-by-side reveal.js renderer

Read the full changelog on https://hedgedoc.org/releases/1.11.1/
